pmc:ChaosMagicPrcAMisconceptionMuchReadingMustPrecedePractice a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Misconception that much reading must precede practice"@en, "Irrtum, vor der Praxis müsse viel gelesen werden"@de ;
    skos:definition "Hine calls it a common misconception that one must have read a great many books before one can practise magic properly."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:PrimeChaos ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Prime Chaos: Adventures in Chaos Magic (Tempe: New Falcon, 1999, second revised edition; first edition Chaos International, 1993), Part I Chaos Is Everywhere, Adventures in Magic, Books, p. 16; read in a full-text layer of the second revised edition" .

pmc:ChaosMagicPrcAReadingReplacesDoingCautela a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Reading replaces doing"@en, "Lesen ersetzt das Tun"@de ;
    skos:definition "Reading widely can consume all one's time so that nothing is ever tried in practice."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:ChaosMagicPrcAMisconceptionMuchReadingMustPrecedePractice ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:PrimeChaos ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Prime Chaos: Adventures in Chaos Magic (Tempe: New Falcon, 1999, second revised edition; first edition Chaos International, 1993), Part I Chaos Is Everywhere, Adventures in Magic, Books, p. 16; read in a full-text layer of the second revised edition" .

pmc:ChaosMagicPrcABooksImplantLimitingOpinionsCautela a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Books implant limiting opinions"@en, "Bücher pflanzen einschränkende Meinungen ein"@de ;
    skos:definition "From books one can unconsciously absorb opinions that limit what one believes one can or cannot do; books deserve respect, not worship, and do not replace practice or conversation."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:ChaosMagicPrcAMisconceptionMuchReadingMustPrecedePractice ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:PrimeChaos ;
