pmc:ChaosMagicPrcBDeliberateAlterationConsciousnessPosture a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Deliberate alteration of consciousness by posture"@en, "Bewusste Bewusstseinsveränderung durch Haltung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Following a deliberate bodily sequence is said to change one's consciousness; deliberateness is the key quality."@en ;
