pmp:ChaosMagicPrcBRitualDrumming a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Ritual drumming"@en, "Rituelles Trommeln"@de ;
    skos:definition "Use the drum to give structure and accompaniment, from simple beats to complex invocatory rhythms as in Voudou and Santeria."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:PrimeChaos ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Prime Chaos: Adventures in Chaos Magic (Tempe: New Falcon, 1999, second revised edition; first edition Chaos International, 1993), Part II Dynamic Ritual, The Components of Ritual, 2. BodyMind Components, h) Music, pp. 106-107; read in a full-text layer of the second revised edition" .

pmc:ChaosMagicPrcBDrummerDrivesRitualPrematureClimaxFailure a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Drummer drives ritual to premature climax"@en, "Trommler treibt das Ritual zum verfrühten Höhepunkt"@de ;
    skos:definition "A drummer can exert undue control over pace; if drumming speeds up the ritual follows, occasionally building to a premature climax."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure: the drummer speeds up, the ritual follows, and it can occasionally build to a premature climax. Cause: the drummer, who holds undue control over the pace. No deadline; rate in words only (occasionally)."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:PrimeChaos ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Prime Chaos: Adventures in Chaos Magic (Tempe: New Falcon, 1999, second revised edition; first edition Chaos International, 1993), Part II Dynamic Ritual, The Components of Ritual, 2. BodyMind Components, h) Music, p. 107; read in a full-text layer of the second revised edition" .

pmp:ChaosMagicPrcBInfusingDeityEnergySacramentalDrink a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Infusing deity energy into sacramental drink"@en, "Gottheitsenergie in sakramentales Getränk einbringen"@de ;
    skos:definition "In a ritual mass, infuse a deity's energy into a chalice of wine so all celebrants partake of the quality invoked (cf. Christian wine and wafers)."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmp:ChaosMagicCondCSacramentalFoodAndDrink (Condensed Chaos, 1995): Condensed Chaos gives sacramental food and drink fitted to the entity and closing feasts; here the deity's energy is infused into a chalice of wine at a ritual mass so that all celebrants share the invoked quality."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:PrimeChaos ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Prime Chaos: Adventures in Chaos Magic (Tempe: New Falcon, 1999, second revised edition; first edition Chaos International, 1993), Part II Dynamic Ritual, The Components of Ritual, 2. BodyMind Components, i) Food & Drink, p. 107; read in a full-text layer of the second revised edition" .

pmc:ChaosMagicPrcBPartakingInvokedQuality a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Partaking of an invoked quality"@en, "Teilhabe an einer invozierten Qualität"@de ;
    skos:definition "Celebrants consuming the infused wine are said to share in the invoked quality."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:PrimeChaos ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Prime Chaos: Adventures in Chaos Magic (Tempe: New Falcon, 1999, second revised edition; first edition Chaos International, 1993), Part II Dynamic Ritual, The Components of Ritual, 2. BodyMind Components, i) Food & Drink, p. 107; read in a full-text layer of the second revised edition" .

pmc:ChaosMagicPrcBRitualMassYieldsSharedInvoked a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Ritual mass yields shared invoked quality"@en, "Ritualmesse erzeugt geteilte invozierte Qualität"@de ;
    skos:definition "Drinking the infused chalice imparts the invoked quality."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicPrcBInfusingDeityEnergySacramentalDrink ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicPrcBPartakingInvokedQuality ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:PrimeChaos ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Prime Chaos: Adventures in Chaos Magic (Tempe: New Falcon, 1999, second revised edition; first edition Chaos International, 1993), Part II Dynamic Ritual, The Components of Ritual, 2. BodyMind Components, i) Food & Drink, p. 107; read in a full-text layer of the second revised edition" .

pmp:ChaosMagicPrcBSumble a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "The Sumble"@en, "Der Sumble (Trinkrunde)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Four rounds of toasts: 1) to Principles each person holds important; 2) to Heroes, living or dead, who inspire; 3) personal Boasts of something accomplished; 4) Oaths stating what one will do, which cannot be made for others."@en ;
    skos:note "As described by Don Webb, from Viking pre-expedition boasts and toasts."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:PrimeChaos ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Prime Chaos: Adventures in Chaos Magic (Tempe: New Falcon, 1999, second revised edition; first edition Chaos International, 1993), Part II Dynamic Ritual, The Components of Ritual, 2. BodyMind Components, i) Food & Drink, The Sumble, pp. 107-108; read in a full-text layer of the second revised edition" .

pmc:ChaosMagicPrcBOwningValuesAchievementsGroupConfidence a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Owning values and achievements; group confidence and commitment"@en, "Werte und Leistungen annehmen; Gruppenvertrauen und Verbindlichkeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "The Sumble helps each identify principles and heroes, own achievements before the group, state an intention, and builds trust and commitment within a group."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:PrimeChaos ;
