    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:PrimeChaos ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Prime Chaos: Adventures in Chaos Magic (Tempe: New Falcon, 1999, second revised edition; first edition Chaos International, 1993), Part II Dynamic Ritual, Example Types of Ritual, Ritual Invocation, Possible Applications, p. 121; read in a full-text layer of the second revised edition" .

